[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2660614194","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102839#issuecomment-2660614194","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102839","id":2660614194,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6elcAy","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-15T01:33:50Z","updated_at":"2025-02-15T02:19:48Z","body":"Poked around abit... \n\nI also see these artifacts on regular UI elements like the slider knob. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e33b708f-7cab-4d51-b4bb-0525d05a6a38)\n\nWhen importing SVGs, there's a default option \"fix alpha border\" that's turned on (`fix_alpha_edges` in code). \nNeither the default theme icons generation from SVGs nor the font glyph rendering calls this.\n\nAdding fix_alpha_edges for these cases fixes this for me. \nSee draft PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102880\n\nThe change for theme icons is probably ok as is. The _font_draw_glyph needs some extra conditions to only do this for SVG glyphs, though not sure how to check for this.","author_ass